platoon 0.6.0 + platoon-tito.patch: (a) a chat-template override for the chat_template renderer
(renderer_kwargs.chat_template: a .jinja path or the text), (b) the context limit (PLATOON_MIN_COMPLETION_TOKENS,
default 2048: a prompt leaving less ends the rollout, graded with reason context_limit; trajectory stat context_limit).
Apply after platoon-tito.patch, in the site-packages directory that holds platoon/:  patch -p1 < platoon-tito2.patch

